skill.description:
Increase move speed by 6 points when moving. Depending on her position on the battlefield, apply different buffs on allies:
 When on the front row, increase self armor by #1 and grant other SG T-Dolls on the same row a #2-point shield every second, stacking up to 5 times;
 When on the back row, increase self damage by #3, increase accuracy and critical rate of MG T-Dolls on the same row by #4 points and #5 respectively.
